  "page": "page-09",
  "idea": "Notion vs Obsidian: which second brain tool is right for you",
  "text": "The honest breakdown between Notion's cloud databases and Obsidian's offline speed. Notion makes project tracking effortless with linked properties, but bloated workspaces can take five seconds just to render on mobile. Cloud-dependent architectures degrade when internet connections flicker, killing productivity during travel. Obsidian solves latency by executing everything locally via lightweight Markdown and customizable Canvas canvases. Use Notion for cross-team project boards and Obsidian for personal deep work.",
